encoding  utf-8
survey "BlackShiver" -title "Blackest of Shivers"

###Inputs, add surveys here###
input 1/BlackShiver1
input 2/BlackShiver2
input 3/BlackShiver3
input 4/BlackShiver4
input 5/BlackShiver5


###Joins, connecting scraps on the surveys###
join S1@BlackShiver3 S4@BlackShiver4
join S1@BlackShiver1 S1@BlackShiver4
join S1@BlackShiver2 S2@BlackShiver5


###Equates, connecting points on surveys###
equate 49@BlackShiver4 11@BlackShiver3
equate 18@BlackShiver2 15@BlackShiver3
equate 6@BlackShiver4 22@BlackShiver1
equate 1@BlackShiver5 1@BlackShiver2


###Map, to create overall map. Input individual survey maps to create the whole###
map plan -projection plan
  plan@BlackShiver5
  plan@BlackShiver2
  break
  plan@BlackShiver3 [-20 -10 m] below
  break
  plan@BlackShiver4
  plan@BlackShiver1
endmap

map plan2 -projection plan
  plan@BlackShiver5
  plan@BlackShiver2
  plan@BlackShiver3
  plan2@BlackShiver4
  plan@BlackShiver1
endmap

endsurvey

